===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*selh₁-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|sellen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sellan||give; give up for money}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*salljan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*saljaną}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*selh₁-}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|sell|t=to sell}}, {{cog|da|sælge|t=to sell}}, {{cog|nb|selge|t=to sell}}, {{cog|nn|selja}}, {{m|nn|selje|t=to sell}}, {{cog|sv|sälja|t=to sell}}, {{cog|fo,is|selja||t=to sell}}, {{cog|got|𐍃𐌰𐌻𐌾𐌰𐌽|t=to pay tribute, make an offer}}.
